": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "27113615221620386"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "558742480090587"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1069201804881215"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "558742480090587"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1732402980, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "558742480090587"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "39073800212268434", "version": "5.1.0"}, "id": "794049176269983", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26557592687222645", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "39073800212268434"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1792803003, "id": "39187583110890143", "version": "5.1.0", "version_code": 278, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26557592687222645", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "39073800212268434"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1792708812, "id": "39158733507108437", "version": "5.1.0", "version_code": 277, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26557592687222645", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "39073800212268434"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1792448906, "id": "39080448851603570", "version": "5.1.0", "version_code": 276, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26557592687222645", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "39073800212268434"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "794049176269983"}]}, "change_log": "**5.1.0: Fully Color Customizable Jutsu Skins (10/18/26)**\n*Dev Note: The next big update will be a new jutsu: Lightning Style: Lightning Storm. It\u2019s a defensive jutsu where you charge and release a field of electricity around you to punish close range attackers. You can follow its development in the experimental app release channel and the playtest channel on discord. *\n\n**Justu Skin Shop Upgrade**\n- You can now purchase full color customization for almost all jutsu skins. (The old color cosmetics for lightning blade, chakra, chakra overdrive, fire blossom, and fireball have been removed and refunded for players who previously owned them.)I \n- Modified swirling spiral to reduce risk of future copyright issues.\n- Added color customization for most kunai and paper bomb skins\n- Added avatar previews for all jutsus skins.\n\n**Fireball Damage Buff**\n*Dev Note: Fireball was recently changed to favor what the defender sees while also being changed to do damage over time instead of instantly killing an opponent. I got a lot of comments saying that it was nerfed a little too hard, so fireball has been buffed to reward accurate placement.*\n- Fireball damage at center is a one shot (fireball damage at edge is still 24 hearts per second)\n\n**Earth Spike Hit Detection Change**\n*Dev Note: Earth spike was recently changed to favor what the defender sees on their screen which has led to a lot less complaints about getting hit by earth spike. However, some attackers feel that their attack is being unfairly substituted. Here\u2019s a middle ground:*\n- If you hit a player on your screen with an earth spike and they were only walking/running, it will count as a hit, even if it barely misses them on their own screen.\n\n**Improved Voice Chat Report System**\n- New report verdict: \u201ctoxicity\u201d. The voice chat report system looks for overly aggressive speech instead of just hate speech. Offending players will receive a warning before receiving a series of escalated mutes (1 hour -> 2 hours -> 4 hours, etc.)\n\n**New Facial Animations**\n- Avatar face animates when shooting fireball/fireblossom\n- Avatar face animates when damage is taken\n\n**bHaptics Support**\n- Added initial vibration support for bHaptics TactSuit Pro, TactSleeves, and TactVisor\n\n**Quality of Life Changes**\n- Added private lobby settings to control barrier closing and chakra for content creation and training in private lobbies\n- Added vibration settings page so you can toggle controller vibrations\n- Improved cpu cost of hit detection\n\n**Bug Fixes**\n- Fixed a bug where impact sound effects would stop prematurely\n- Fixed a rendering bug where large visual effects like chakra overdrive would hide outer visual effects if you were too close to them\n- Fixed a LIV camera follow glitch in first person\n- Added a connection test option for players who can\u2019t connect to the ranking server", "created_date": 1792427494, "id": "39073800212268434", "version": "5.1.0", "version_code": 275, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26557592687222645", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "39073800212268434"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "794049176269983"}]}, "change_log": "**5.1.0: Fully Color Customizable Jutsu Skins (10/18/26)**\n*Dev Note: The next big update will be a new jutsu: Lightning Style: Lightning Storm. It\u2019s a defensive jutsu where you charge and release a field of electricity around you to punish close range attackers. You can follow its development in the experimental app release channel and the playtest channel on discord. *\n\n**Justu Skin Shop Upgrade**\n- You can now purchase full color customization for almost all jutsu skins. (The old color cosmetics for lightning blade, chakra, chakra overdrive, fire blossom, and fireball have been removed and refunded for players who previously owned them.)I \n- Modified swirling spiral to reduce risk of future copyright issues.\n- Added color customization for most kunai and paper bomb skins\n- Added avatar previews for all jutsus skins.\n\n**Fireball Damage Buff**\n*Dev Note: Fireball was recently changed to favor what the defender sees while also being changed to do damage over time instead of instantly killing an opponent. I got a lot of comments saying that it was nerfed a little too hard, so fireball has been buffed to reward accurate placement.*\n- Fireball damage at center is a one shot (fireball damage at edge is still 24 hearts per second)\n\n**Earth Spike Hit Detection Change**\n*Dev Note: Earth spike was recently changed to favor what the defender sees on their screen which has led to a lot less complaints about getting hit by earth spike. However, some attackers feel that their attack is being unfairly substituted. Here\u2019s a middle ground:*\n- If you hit a player on your screen with an earth spike and they were only walking/running, it will count as a hit, even if it barely misses them on their own screen.\n\n**Improved Voice Chat Report System**\n- New report verdict: \u201ctoxicity\u201d. The voice chat report system looks for overly aggressive speech instead of just hate speech. Offending players will receive a warning before receiving a series of escalated mutes (1 hour -> 2 hours -> 4 hours, etc.)\n\n**New Facial Animations**\n- Avatar face animates when shooting fireball/fireblossom\n- Avatar face animates when damage is taken\n\n**bHaptics Support**\n- Added initial vibration support for bHaptics TactSuit Pro, TactSleeves, and TactVisor\n\n**Quality of Life Changes**\n- Added private lobby settings to control barrier closing and chakra for content creation and training in private lobbies\n- Added vibration settings page so you can toggle controller vibrations\n- Improved cpu cost of hit detection\n\n**Bug Fixes**\n- Fixed a bug where impact sound effects would stop prematurely\n- Fixed a rendering bug where large visual effects like chakra overdrive would hide outer visual effects if you were too close to them\n- Fixed a LIV camera follow glitch in first person\n- Added a connection test option for players who can\u2019t connect to the ranking server", "created_date": 1792354856, "id": "39052633967718392", "version": "5.1.0", "version_code": 274, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}